OL,3,GNEWSAManx government systems hit by
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople on the Isle of Man have been
OL,7,Furged to use counter services and
OL,8,Ftelephone lines to access government
OL,9,Fresources in the wake of a global
OL,10,Foutage of Microsoft systems.
OL,12,FManx officials said due to emails are
OL,13,Fnot currently being received, those
OL,14,Fwith urgent needs should use other
OL,15,Fmethods of contact.
OL,17,FThe outage, which has seen connectivity
OL,18,Fissues with tools including Teams,
OL,19,FOutlook, Copilot and OneDrive, is
OL,20,Faffecting public services and
OL,21,Fbusinesses across about 70 countries
OL,22,Fworldwide.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
